OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANo 10 posers, petitioners and
OL,4,A(occasional) policymakers
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the distinctive features of
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham's time in
OL,8,Foffice has been his enthusiasm for
OL,9,Fengaging with social media influencers
OL,10,Fas a means to communicate with
OL,11,Fdifferent groups of voters, especially
OL,12,Fthe younger ones.
OL,14,FThis has attracted criticism, not least
OL,15,Ffrom Leader of the Opposition Kemi
OL,16,FBadenoch, who claimed the door was a
OL,17,Fsymbol of "democracy" and "dignity" and
OL,18,Fshould not be thus sullied.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
