OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1795877756
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANo 10 posers, petitioners and
OL,4,A(occasional) policymakers
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Downing Street has long been a
OL,7,Fcatwalk (literally, most days), the
OL,8,Fdoorstep of Number 10 a podium for
OL,9,Fposing, and the pavement a stage for
OL,10,Fhi-jinks in the name of raising
OL,11,Fawareness.
OL,13,FFrom Richard Briers rocking up with
OL,14,Fboxes of petitions "against the
OL,15,Fslaughter of seal cubs" to sports
OL,16,Fstars' laudable ambition of eradicating
OL,17,Fmalaria, here are some of the moments
OL,18,Fwhen the facade served as a backdrop
OL,19,Ffor famous, and not so famous, faces.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
